  "abstract": "<jats:p>The authors are named as inventors on patents FI129515B and U.S. Patent No. 11,793,779 both of which were filed by Salarusta Ltd, these patents are related to this work and the patents cover the use of a substance on a treatment of arthritis. The authors have an ownership interest in Salarusta Ltd Oy. The authors have no other competing interests such as relevant affiliations or financial involvement with any organization or entity with a financial interest in or financial conflict with the subject matter or materials discussed in the manuscript. This includes employment, consultancies, honoraria, stock ownership or options, expert testimony, grants, or patents received or pending, or royalties.</jats:p>",
